      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Deterministic code check   ← BEST\n   JSON parse hua? schema match? link valid?\n2. Reference-based\n   exact match, F1, recall@k\n3. LLM-as-judge   ← last resort\n   sasta aur flexible, par CALIBRATE karo:\n   50 cases pe human se agreement check\n4. Human review — sample, har baar nahi",
      "originalText": "1. Deterministic code check   ← BEST\n   JSON parse hua? schema match? link valid?\n2. Reference-based\n   exact match, F1, recall@k\n3. LLM-as-judge   ← last resort\n   sasta aur flexible, par CALIBRATE karo:\n   50 cases pe human se agreement check\n4. Human review — sample, har baar nahi",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
