      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Production traces se REAL failures uthao\n   (synthetic cases se shuru mat karo)\n2. Har failure ko category do — 5–8 buckets\n3. Har category se 3–10 cases lo\n4. Expected outcome likho — output nahi,\n   VERIFIABLE property likho\n5. Dataset ko git mein version karo\n6. Har naye prod bug → naya eval case\n\n20 acche cases > 500 synthetic cases.",
      "originalText": "1. Production traces se REAL failures uthao\n   (synthetic cases se shuru mat karo)\n2. Har failure ko category do — 5–8 buckets\n3. Har category se 3–10 cases lo\n4. Expected outcome likho — output nahi,\n   VERIFIABLE property likho\n5. Dataset ko git mein version karo\n6. Har naye prod bug → naya eval case\n\n20 acche cases > 500 synthetic cases.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
