      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "✗ 'Maine prompt badla, better lag raha hai'\n   → kitna better? kis case pe? measure karo.\n✗ Ek saath 3 cheezein badalna\n   → kaunsi cheez ne kaam kiya, pata nahi chalega\n✗ Eval set model ko dikha dena (leak)\n✗ Sirf happy path test karna\n✗ LLM judge ko bina calibrate kiye trust karna\n✗ Eval sirf launch se pehle chalana",
      "originalText": "✗ 'Maine prompt badla, better lag raha hai'\n   → kitna better? kis case pe? measure karo.\n✗ Ek saath 3 cheezein badalna\n   → kaunsi cheez ne kaam kiya, pata nahi chalega\n✗ Eval set model ko dikha dena (leak)\n✗ Sirf happy path test karna\n✗ LLM judge ko bina calibrate kiye trust karna\n✗ Eval sirf launch se pehle chalana",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
