      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "❌  assert output == expected\n      (non-deterministic system — ye flake karega)\n\n✅  runs = [run(c) for c in cases for _ in range(3)]\n      assert success_rate(runs) > 0.80\n      assert median_cost(runs) < 0.50\n      assert p95_steps(runs) < 20\n\nThreshold pe assert karo, exact output pe nahi.",
      "originalText": "❌  assert output == expected\n      (non-deterministic system — ye flake karega)\n\n✅  runs = [run(c) for c in cases for _ in range(3)]\n      assert success_rate(runs) > 0.80\n      assert median_cost(runs) < 0.50\n      assert p95_steps(runs) < 20\n\nThreshold pe assert karo, exact output pe nahi.",
      "textAlign": "left",
